   - Then `EAX = quotient*10`, `ECX = ECX - EAX` → `ECX = ECX % 10`.

6. `input[i+1] = (ECX % 10) + 0x30` — **writes back** the new digit into `input[i+1]`.

7. `i++`, loop.

